- **Links2Care EarlyON:** Their page says the programs are free, drop-in and in person, and run at Acton and Georgetown. It also says the current schedule is on the page, but I could only see an old summer 2025 schedule. I left out the day and time rather than guess.
- **Kids & Me:** Halton Region's page lists this as free and weekly. The Halton Hills Public Library page says it's run with Links2Care and the library. I couldn't tie a specific Halton Hills day and time to it, so I left those out.

I left out Halton Hills Gymnastics Centre's preschool drop-in for under-4s because it costs $15 per visit, so it isn't free.
